    "body": "Merge order: do not merge this PR before #4201.\n\n- This PR has the base `main`, but it contains the commits of #4201 (`7ce62c040`, `8fd0a47ec`). A merge of this PR also lands #4201.\n- #4201 has an open `needs-rework` from NeoTech. The finding (the PR body must say `Refs #3644`) is fixed, but the request is not withdrawn yet.\n- Commit `7ce62c040` has `Fixes #3644` in its message. A merge closes #3644, which is partial work.\n\nMerge #4201 first. Then this PR shows only its own three commits (`8fd0a47ec..745234df7`), and it can merge. A review of this PR is still welcome now.",
